DH; M1c&#x0003d;other visceral metastases or an elevated serum LDH. Low risk denotes a normal LDH, and a normal neutrophil count, and a performance status of 0&#x02013;1. Intermediate risk denotes any combination of at least one but not all variables elevated. High risk denotes an elevated LDH, an elevated neutrophil count, and a performance status of 2.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote6"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic>-values are overall estimates for all levels.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote7"><label>a</label><p><italic>N</italic>&#x0003d;321, 302 deaths.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>